                                "sense_id": "fe314c83-9d60-31f7-a298-3b8d3c2af380",
                                "text": "Aqueous extracts of leaves and culms contained scopolines, scopoletin, chlorogenic acid and isochlorogenic acid (Abdul-Wahab and Al-Naib, 1972)."
